{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "e62d0c94-88a3-82ed-88bd-15d3d84ab04d",
  "created_at": "2026-01-27T19:20:07-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Luis Teixeira",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T19:15:13-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works storm line, this is Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T19:15:17-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yeah, I know it's after hours for City Hall, I saw the recording say to call this number for storm stuff. So I'm hoping that's right."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T19:15:30-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right, this line stays open for storm issues in the evening. What's going on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T19:15:38-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's the street in front of my house. It's basically a pond. I'm at 402 Chapel Street, up on the Hill. Cars keep coming through and they're throwing wakes, like actual waves, up onto my front steps."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T19:15:56-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. And is this from the storm over the weekend, the snow turning to rain?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T19:16:04-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, Sunday into Monday. Well, no, it's still sitting there tonight, so it's not just from then. The water never went down. Sorry, you asked if it was from the storm. Yes. It was from the storm, and it never drained."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T19:16:23-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that makes sense. So the water's pooled at the curb in front of your place, and it's still there Tuesday night."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T19:16:34-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right. Like, the whole low spot. My neighbor across the street, he's been here a lot longer than me, he says it does this every big rain. Every single one. So this isn't new, apparently. Which is kind of the point."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T19:16:53-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, I hear you. Do you know if the drain right there is covered over with snow or slush, or can you see the grate?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T19:17:05-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Uh, it's a Tuesday, I get home around six. Wait, no, that's not what you asked. I can see the grate, kind of. There's leaves and gray slush packed on top of it. Water's just sitting over it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T19:17:23-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, that's helpful. A packed grate would do exactly that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T19:17:28-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So when did they last come by? Like, has anybody cleaned that drain? Because it sure doesn't look like it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T19:17:38-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Let me pull up the log for Chapel Street. Bear with me a second, I've got to get past this screen."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T19:17:48-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Take your time. I'm dealing with my own computer thing anyway, there's a pop-up window that keeps coming up on my laptop and I can't close it. I tried the X and it just opens another one. Anyway, sorry, that's nothing to do with you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T19:18:09-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ha, don't click anything on those. Okay, here we go. I'm seeing a crew note on that block, but it's from the fall, before the leaves were done coming down. Nothing since the storm."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T19:18:25-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So nothing since the fall. Great. So that's, what, months? And the street's a lake."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T19:18:33-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's what the log shows, yes. I'll put in a work order for that drain to be cleared and flag that there's standing water and traffic throwing spray toward the house."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T19:18:48-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good, because honestly I feel like I'm reporting the same thing the neighbor's been reporting for years, and nothing changes. When is somebody actually going to show up?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T19:19:01-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Crews are still working through a long list from the storm. Realistically I'd say the next couple of days, and drains with standing water like yours get moved up. Can I get a callback number in case dispatch needs to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T19:19:21-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, it's 401-555-0182. That's my cell."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T19:19:25-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 401-555-0182. And it's Luis?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T19:19:29-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Luis Teixeira, T-E-I-X-E-I-R-A."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T19:19:31-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect. One more thing, if the water starts coming toward the house or the walkway, call back right away and tell whoever answers it's an update on this order."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T19:19:45-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I just want it dealt with this time, not logged and forgotten."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T19:19:52-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. It's in the system tonight, and it'll be on the crew's sheet in the morning."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T19:20:00-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. Thanks, Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T19:20:02-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Luis. Stay out of the splash zone."
    }
  ],
